{
  "nodeVersion": "v24.21.0",
  "proxyAllow": {
    "_comment": "Hosts the egress proxy lets every session reach besides the ELM gateway (subdomains included). PyPI, so pip and uv can install Python packages into the agent's environment; the container registries, so a Podman that pulls through the proxy can fetch images (Docker's engine pulls by itself, outside it). See LOCKDOWN.md.",
