    "_comment": "bootstrap.sh --with-pypi-index: a snapshot of PyPI's package metadata (Hugging Face dataset, pinned to a revision; each file is checked against its published sha256), built into agent/pypi-index.db for `pypi-search`. A new revision here is fetched and rebuilt on the next run.",
