  "excludedTools": {
    "_comment": "Tools not sent to the model, beside the web tools: every tool's definition goes with every request, so one rarely used costs its length on all of them. 'always': never offered (notebook edits with simple substitutes: write_cell sets a cell's type, nbconvert clears outputs, delete and insert move). 'workflows': offered only in a session started with `pi --workflows` (or PI_ELM_WORKFLOWS=1). pi ignores an exclusion for a tool that does not exist, so a renamed tool must be renamed here too.",
    "always": [
      "notebook_merge",
      "notebook_change_cell_type",
      "notebook_read_cell_attachment",
      "notebook_clear_outputs",
      "notebook_move"
